363", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596068480_1114164464736696_2136799870268323749_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bOpkYzoX3UcQ7kNvwFXPxEL&_nc_oc=AdpaSrLtL5oCKFnXzL3wuDzeEKUxB5EgJJd4Y4T3aTapfQpyV68JlL7iTgABdWlq5mM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQRD6bnSZ42tRaYC9qq-LvIRY4UcsNDttB1Z-evz_XDvg&oe=6AF88E2D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1819216295916755", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831393_1819216299250088_2953447010011446266_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8AS-Ptwb6ZwQ7kNvwF2h5ao&_nc_oc=Adopdgunaf9QMmZl4lZVglGLXdbxCMcUFeoH0vBcr3FG4yrh1qE74SkzgPca2McZiSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTUd3QEFA6e-ddP1BPs0poKzVteMUwFvzA_xXPusH93vw&oe=6AF8A7AA"}, "display_name": "Art Studio", "keywords": ["art", "painting", "paint", "canvas", "graffiti"], "long_description": "Art Studio is a calm, hyper-real painting studio for Meta Quest. Walk through a bright apartment studio with herringbone oak floors, crown moulding and big windows, slide open the glass door, and step out onto a balcony over blue ocean, beaches and palm trees.\n\nPAINT FOR REAL\nPick up a brush and dip it into a blob of paint on the palette or straight from a tube. Press it to the canvas and paint - no buttons, no menus. Press harder for a wider stroke.\n\nFIVE EASELS, FIVE BRUSHES\nTwo easels in the window light, a big 1.5 metre canvas and a second easel in the gallery room, and a plein-air easel on the balcony facing the view. Each easel has its own side table with a palette of 12 artist colours, four brushes, a water jar to rinse and a rag to wipe paint away. Choose from a fine detail brush, a round, and flat brushes up to 40 mm.\n\nSPRAY PAINT\nEight spray cans wait on a cart by the balcony door. Pull the trigger and spray the balcony walls or any canvas - hold it close for a sharp line or back off for a soft fog.\n\nNOTHING IS LOST\nEvery canvas and every wall saves itself automatically. Take the headset off, come back tomorrow, and your paintings are exactly where you left them.\n\nA STUDIO TO SPEND TIME IN\nA gallery of oil paintings, a worktable of paint tubes and brushes, a vintage radio playing relaxed jazz and lounge tracks, and the sound of the ocean through the balcony door.\n\nDeveloped and published by Citiview Group.", "short_description": "Your own sunlit art studio with an ocean view. Pick up a real brush, dip it in paint and paint on easel canvases, or grab a spray can and tag the balcony walls. Five easels, 12 artist colours, 5 brushes, 8 spray cans and a gallery of paintings - and everything you paint saves itself."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://citiview-artstudio.pages.dev/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Citiview Group", "support_website_url": "https://citiview-artstudio.pages.dev/", "website_url": "https://citiview-artstudio.pages.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1245124582026848"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1827578852012034"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1827578852012034"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 178